  "name": "UK Engagement with Space Committee",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>The UK Engagement with Space Committee published its report T<a href=\"https://publications.parliament.uk/pa/ld5901/ldselect/ldukspace/190/190.pdf\">he Space Economy: Act Now or Lose</a> Out 4 November 2025. The <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/government-response-to-the-house-of-lords-uk-engagement-with-space-committee-report-the-space-economy-act-now-or-lose-out\">Government responded</a> on 30 January 2026. The report was <a href=\"https://hansard.parliament.uk/lords/2026-07-09/debates/95278C36-F69C-48F9-8CAE-7C6EC3B02CBB/TheSpaceEconomy(UKEngagementWithSpaceCommitteeReport)\">debated</a> 9 July 2026.</p>\r\n<p>Follow the Committee on <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/lordsukspacecom.parliament.uk\">Bluesky</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/uk-engagement-with-space-committee/\">LinkedIn</a>, or <a href=\"https://x.com/LordsUKSpaceCom\">X (formerly Twitter)</a>.&nbsp;</p>",
